# The per-script Rekor fake: every script gets its own at $REKOR_URL, driven
# through the rekor command, so the switches of one script never leak into
# another. rekor pubkey writes the log's current key for pinning; rekor rotate
# changes it; rekor requests asserts how many requests the fake has seen.

rekor requests 0
rekor pubkey anchor.pub
grep 'BEGIN PUBLIC KEY' anchor.pub
cp anchor.pub before.pub
rekor rotate
rekor pubkey anchor.pub
! cmp anchor.pub before.pub
rekor posture integrity.yaml
grep 'anchor: tlog' integrity.yaml
grep 'url: http://127.0.0.1:' integrity.yaml
rekor requests 0
